1. Orthogonality: For any two vectors \(v_i\) and \(v_j\) in the set, \(\langle v_i, v_j \rangle = 0\) if \(i \neq j\).
2. Normalization: Each vector \(v_i\) in the set satisfies \(\|v_i\| = 1\).
</ANSWER>
