Take the reciprocal to find \( C_{eq} \):

\[ C_{eq} = 1200 \text{ pF} \]

Next, consider the uncertainties. The uncertainty in \( C_{eq} \) can be found using the propagation of uncertainty formula for addition of reciprocals:

\[ \left( \frac{\Delta C_{eq}}{C_{eq}} \right)^2 = \left( \frac{\Delta C_1}{C_1} \right)^2 + \left( \frac{\Delta C_2}{C_2} \right)^2 \]

